+# Independent adversarial audit: 72-will-it-fly
+
+## Audit result
+
+The candidate contains a legitimate, result-constraining partial-correctness
+proof of the submitted generated program over finite integer lists and integer
+weight bounds. I rebuilt all definitions from source, independently ran every
+positive claim, checked the generated semantics rule by rule, demonstrated
+program-body sensitivity, and obtained the expected failure from a fresh false
+result mutation.
+
+## 1. Input and provenance integrity
+
